/*
 * Implements semantic validation for static field access on class types
 * using the path operator `::`.
 *
 * Supported static fields:
 *   - Constructors(named or unnamed)
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::path::class_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/path/class_.yr
 * @Author(s):
